        "visible_text": "MENAPARK — TECH Products reviewed by the community\nUpdates >>>\nSix products listed this month · Four projects open for partners\nSearch the community\nM\nMENAPARK\nDiscover\nCommunity\nAbout\nSign in\nMENA Business Leaders Community\nMENA Region Meeting in Istanbul for Business Networking\nCompanies , Mentors, Consultants, Workshops and Networking for MENA & TÜRKİYE\nJoin with Google\nExplore products\nRecently added products\n6\nlisted\nE\nEngineering Workshop 1 on Management and Leadership by İbrahim Bisharat\nby İbrahim Bisharat\nMENAPARK ACADEMY\nI\nINVEETO.COM\nEvent Tech SaaS for Stakeholders Engagement\nBusiness Alliance\nEvent Tech\nA\nAI Transformation Framework by Mohammad Khoudari for MENAPARK\nHow do we transform a business with AI?\nMENAPARK ACADEMY\nAI\nLectures\nWorkshops\nM\nMEAL DPro  Certification\nMEAL DPro sets out a common language and a practical framework for planning and running monitoring, evaluation, accountability and learning across the project cycle. It equips practitioners to design MEAL systems that produce credible evidence and support better decisions\nLevel 5 Consulting Group\nTraining Certification\nP\nPMP Examination Preparation  Certification\nThis course prepares experienced project managers for the PMI Project Management Professional (PMP) examination, the most widely recognised project management credential globally. It covers all domains in the current PMP Examination Content Outline across predictive, agile, and hybrid environments, and provides intensive practice examination preparation for candidates who meet PMI eligibility requirements.\nLevel 5 Consulting Group\nTraining Certification\nC\nCAPM Examination Preparation  Certification\nThis course prepares candidates for the PMI Certified Associate in Project Management (CAPM) examination, providing comprehensive coverage of the PMBOK Guide and the competencies tested in the CAPM Examination Content Outline. It is designed for professionals with limited formal project management experience who wish to establish a recognised entry-level project management credential from the Project Management Institute.\nLevel 5 Consulting Group\nTraining Certification\nOpen discussions\nSee all\nProjects looking for partners\nSee all\nIn delivery\nGroup-wide identity programme\nConsolidating seven directories into one identity platform with automated joiner–mover–leaver flows across 14 000 employees.\nOpen for partners\nWarehouse automation and ERP integration\nConnecting an existing ERP to automated storage hardware, with real-time stock accuracy as the acceptance criterion.\nOpen for partners\nCustomer service copilot\nA retrieval-based assistant over 11 years of support tickets, with a human review gate before any customer-facing reply.\nCategories covered by the community\nConsulting\nBusiness Applications\nAI\nSoftware\nCybersecurity\n©\n2026\nMENAPARK\nBy the community, for the community.\nEdit with",
